---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PatchGenerator from '../components/PatchGenerator.svelte';
---

<BaseLayout title="Patch Generator" description="Generate randomized but musically-sensible Deluge synth presets. Download as XML for your SD card.">
  <section class="page-header">
    <h1 class="page-title">Patch Generator</h1>
    <p class="page-desc">Generate random Deluge synth presets tuned by category.</p>
    <details class="page-details">
        <summary>How it works &amp; limitations</summary>
        <ul>
          <li>You can drop the generated XML into your Deluge SD card's <code>SYNTHS</code> folder and load it as a new preset.</li>
          <li>The "Preview" button is experimental and cool, but don't expect a 1:1 match with what the Deluge will output. Sometimes it's fairly close, others it's hilariously off.</li>
          <li>Disclaimer: most of these start out kind of bad, but it's perfectly possible to arrive at a good patch with some slight adjustments to the random output.</li>
        </ul>
      </details>
  </section>
  <section class="tool-area">
    <PatchGenerator client:only="svelte" />
  </section>
  <section class="info">
    <div class="info-inner">
      <div class="info-block">
        <h3>How it works</h3>
        <p>Pick a category (pad, lead, bass, keys, FX) and hit generate. Each category constrains randomization to musically useful ranges — pads get slow attacks, bass gets low octaves, leads get bright filters.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="info-block">
        <h3>Using patches</h3>
        <p>Download the .XML file and place it in your Deluge SD card's <code>SYNTHS</code> folder. Load it as a new preset from the Deluge's preset browser.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="info-block">
        <h3>Lock & iterate</h3>
        <p>Click the lock icon on any section to keep it fixed while re-randomizing everything else. Use history to recall previous patches.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem 2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .page-title {
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .page-desc {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .tool-area {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem 3rem;
  }

  .info {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
  }
  .info-inner {
    max-width: 960px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
  }
  .info-block h3 {
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }
  .info-block p {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
</style>
